    {
      "id": "claim_2c2c25ddb0d546a397521ccdb56c10ed",
      "statement": "runOpenWikiIngestion is the personal-mode ingestion orchestrator: it loads env, ensures the OpenWiki home, reads the onboarding config, builds the connector registry (or uses an injected one), resolves the target to source instances, and either runs each source through a per-source agent update (legacy path) or, with OPENWIKI_PERSONAL_CORE=1, pulls every source and then runs one lifecycle-core update; it returns one SourceIngestionResult per source instance.",
